Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianCrossingNearVan" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obs1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian crossing road in front of vehicle" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Van obscuring view of pedestrian" .

:obs1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Traffic cones and construction obstacle" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with pedestrian stepping into path from behind a vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Pedestrian stepping into the vehicle's path from behind an occluding van in foggy conditions.
Severity Score: 0.92